expression: text
---
Signed-in browsers, apps and CLIs of your account. Sign one or all others out.

Usage: hn sessions [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list    List where you are signed in
  revoke  Sign a session out, or all others

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn sessions
  hn sessions revoke <id>
  hn sessions revoke --others
